# ── Participant data — NEVER COMMIT ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything under analysis/participant-data/ is real participant data or
# output derived from it (raw export, result tables, figures, .sav files, and
# the Q-full coding sheets, which carry real PIDs and raw typed answers). The
# analysis scripts default their inputs and outputs into this folder, so the
# separation holds without anyone having to remember it. See
# analysis/participant-data/README.txt.
analysis/participant-data/

# Belt-and-braces: catch participant-derived output even if it lands outside
# the folder above (e.g. a script run with an explicit --out).
analysis/results/
analysis/data/
analysis/**/results_4_2/
analysis/sample_data/
analysis/rubric/coding_qfull_v1.csv
analysis/rubric/qfull_blind_sheet.csv
analysis/rubric/Qfull_coding_card_v1.xlsx
*_PID_MAPPING_DO_NOT_SHARE.csv
*_SHAREABLE.xlsx

# Python bytecode from the analysis scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
